================================================================================
Model weights and optional runtimes
================================================================================

No model weights, runtime binaries, or trained checkpoints are distributed in
this repository. They are downloaded from their original publishers by the
`make setup-model-*` targets, and each remains under its own licence.

models/manifest.json is the authoritative record: every entry carries the
publisher, homepage, pinned URL or revision, SHA-256 checksum, and licence.

Every entry installed today is permissively licensed and usable commercially:
MIT for the NCNN/Vulkan runtime, BSD-3-Clause for the Real-ESRGAN weights, and
Apache-2.0 for SwinIR-L. None carries a noncommercial restriction. See the
Licensing section of README.md for the summary.

Should a weight whose licence forbids commercial use ever be added, it will get
its own install target and Python extra so that enabling it is a deliberate act,
and its restriction will be carried through to the result rather than left in
this file. Nothing here relies on that today, and the repository integrity tests
keep this paragraph and models/manifest.json from disagreeing.
